 --no-undefined

---
 debian/changelog | 6 ++++++
 debian/control   | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index a51e64a..90d75e9 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+cutefish-kwin-plugins (0.8+remastered7) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * cutefish_blur: initialise the cutefishblur resources (Q_INIT_RESOURCE(blur) was undefined and aborted kwin_wayland); link with --no-undefined
+
+ -- Cutefish Remastered <remastered@localhost>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:42:07 +0600
+
 cutefish-kwin-plugins (0.8+remastered6) resolute; urgency=medium
 
   * cutefish_blur: KWin 6.6.6's blur as our own effect (force blur classes, full strength for forced windows, five downsample levels, strength 1-20); KWin's blur disabled
diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
index 2c99cc7..53901d2 100644
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -13,6 +13,10 @@ Build-Depends: cmake,
                libdrm-dev,
                libepoxy-dev,
                libwayland-dev,
+               libxcb-composite0-dev,
+               libxcb-randr0-dev,
+               libxcb-shm0-dev,
+               libxcb1-dev,
                pkg-config,
                qt6-base-dev,
                qt6-declarative-dev
